# The real download artifacts are copied into public/ from arch-lang-server's
# dist/ immediately before `wrangler pages deploy` (see README.md). They are
# deliberately NOT committed here — the source of truth is the language-tools
# release, and committing large binaries to the website's gh-pages branch
# would bloat it and risk shipping stale copies.
#
# _worker.js and index.html ARE tracked — only the artifacts are ignored.
public/*.vsix
public/*.zip

# Local-only secret for `wrangler pages dev` smoke tests — never commit.
.dev.vars

# Wrangler local state / miniflare cache (created by `wrangler pages dev`).
.wrangler/
